e. Plan her days with training, rest, conversations, therapy, and more. You can even squeeze in some extra night training when she should probably be sleeping.But every decision comes at a cost. You’ll need to balance five stats: Sync, Integrity, Trust, Fatigue, and Depressi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:36:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691848","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3466240-1840944183786864","game_id":"steam-3466240","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo Is Out Now! Lana Needs You…","summary":"Hey, Technomasters!I’m happy to finally say that the demo for Valkyrie Iteration: Mecha Pilot Raising Pocket Simulator is now available!You’ll become Lana’s Technomaster, taking care of both her and the mech Valkyrie. Plan her days with training, rest, conversations, therapy, and more. You can even squeeze in some extra night training when she should probably be sleeping.You’ll need to balance five stats: Sync, Integrity, Trust, Fatigue, and Depression. You can’t keep everything perfect. Trainin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T17:44:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183786864","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3466240-1832700592786841","game_id":"steam-3466240","kind":"announcement","title":"New screenshots and gameplay footage for The Storyteller's Festival!","summary":"Hey, Ternox here. Valkyrie Iteration is part of The Storyteller's Festival, so here are some fresh screenshots and a bit of gameplay.Valkyrie Iteration it's a mini raising sim where you play the Technomaster looking after a pilot named Lana and her mech. One run is 28 in-game days - about 30–40 minutes of real time. You pick what she does each day: train, talk, therapy, repair, install parts, take a memory chip, maybe push for an extra training session at night when she should be sleeping.Five s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-13T16:03:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592786841","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3466240-1808061939355502","game_id":"steam-3466240","kind":"announcement","title":"Four New Announcements","summary":"My name is Ternox, and I’m an indie developer. Recently, I’ve also become an indie publisher of small games — mostly visual novels — as I run the Ukrainian Visual Novel Jam and look for interesting projects that could use some help with promotion. https://clan.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/25363761/88a36b136b3516cbf8ce55cf6edc23fcdccd6fbb.jpg Together with other developers, we’ve prepared four game announcements you can already add to your wishlist. Valkyrie Iteration: Mecha Pilot Raising Pocket","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-15T00:07:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1808061939355502","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3466240":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:12Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:12Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3466240":"2026-10-26T10:38:12Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3466240":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:12Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:12Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:12Z"},"4701440":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:12Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26